{"last_link_id": 30, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [8, 15, 19], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [460, 150], "pos": [0, 710], "widgets_values": ["lanczos", 1, 32], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 1, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscale_method"}, "name": "upscale_method", "label": "upscale_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "upscale_method"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "megapixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution_steps"}, "name": "resolution_steps", "label": "resolution_steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "resolution_steps"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 11, "type": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels", "title": "人物工作尺寸｜不裁剪，约1MP，32像素对齐", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "slot_index": 0, "links": [2], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "slot_index": 1, "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [490, 550], "pos": [0, 960], "widgets_values": ["只出现一个人物，人物身份来自图1。保持这个人的五官、脸型、发型、肤色、体型和衣着，不增加或复制人物。\n图2和图3分别是两件不同的道具，分别保持它们的身份，不互相混合。对每件道具，保持参考道具可辨认的外形、主要颜色、材质、部件、朝向关系和合理尺寸，不把道具参考图的背景或其他人物带入结果。\n让人物真实握持道具，允许调整前臂、手腕和手指以形成自然握持。手指与物体有正确的包握、支撑和前后遮挡关系；不要让物体悬浮、穿过手掌或与手指融为一体。\n按人物图的光照给道具重新照明，在手掌、手指与物体接触处加入合理的接触阴影。让皮肤、衣服和物体的清晰度、色温与颗粒感协调。避免重复道具、额外手臂、断指、轮廓白边和拼贴效果。\n只生成一张单一视角的人物持物图片，不生成多视角拼图、人物设定表、分屏或文字说明。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 120, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "title": "人物 / 道具保持要求｜图号说明与融合规则", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "slot_index": 0, "links": [3], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "slot_index": 1, "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [490, 550], "pos": [540, 960], "widgets_values": ["人物自己的右手握持图2的道具，人物自己的左手握持图3的道具。两件物体分别只出现一次，不能交换、融合或复制。\n左右手按人物自身的解剖方向判断，不按观看者屏幕左右判断，也不要镜像人物或道具。\n两只手在腰部前方自然持物，物体之间留有间隔。握住各自适合抓握的位置，使每件道具的主要外形清楚可见。按道具实际用途与尺寸安排握持；根据具体道具修改这里的抓握部位、摆放高度、朝向和尺寸。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 121, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "title": "主要修改这里｜用哪只手、怎么拿、朝向与尺寸", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "slot_index": 0, "links": [5], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "slot_index": 1, "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [490, 550], "pos": [1080, 960], "widgets_values": ["尽量保持图1原有的相机角度和人物朝向，脸部、双手和完整道具都清楚可见，避免在画面边缘截断手腕或物体。\n如果图1中的手部没有入镜，可适度拉远取景并补全自然的手臂姿态；保留人物身份与服装。图1的背景只用于这张人物参考图，不另行添加故事场景。\n嘴部自然闭合，姿态稳定。输出一张适合作为后续人物入景参考的持物图片。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 122, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "title": "构图与拍摄角度｜单一视角，完整展示手和道具", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [4], "label": "STRING", "type": "*", "localized_name": "STRING"}, {"name": "show_help", "slot_index": 1, "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [340, 90], "pos": [1670, 980], "widgets_values": ["\n\n"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name":